cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artefact, please cite the paper below."
title: "WAF-2: A Consortium-Ledger Trust Registry for Cross-Domain Wi-Fi Roaming — research artefact"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artefact for WAF-2: a permissioned consortium-ledger trust
  registry that supplies membership and revocation for cross-domain Wi-Fi
  roaming while leaving IEEE 802.1X/EAP-TLS and the 802.11i four-way handshake
  unmodified. Contains the Solidity registry, five ProVerif models, a
  deterministic EVM gas benchmark, and a harness that measures revocation
  propagation on live multi-node Clique consortia.
type: software
